---
import LinkButton from "./linkButton.astro";
---

<section>
  <div>
    <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: var(--num-l);">
      At a glance
    </h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Split Attraction Model</h3>
        <p>
          This is a framework that distinguishes between the different types of
          attraction that one might feel. It communicates to us that attractions
          don't always overlap with each other, so an asexual person might
          experience other attractions, such as homoromantic attraction.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Attraction Types</h3>
        <p>
          <b>Romantic</b>: THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER
        </p>
        <p>
          <b>Sexual</b>: THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER
        </p>
        <p>
          <b>Platonic</b>:THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Desire vs Attraction</h3>
        <p>
          <b>Attraction</b>: THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER
        </p>
        <p>
          <b>Desire</b>: THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="more">
      <p>There are many other terms to know about</p>
      <LinkButton link="/terms">Learn More</LinkButton>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section {
    background-color: var(--clr-primary);
    padding-block: var(--num-l);
  }

  .cards {
    --columns: calc((100% - var(--num-l) * 3) / 3);

    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(
      auto-fit,
      minmax(max(350px, var(--columns)), 1fr)
    );
    column-gap: var(--num-l);
    row-gap: var(--num-m);
  }

  .card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--num-m);
    background-color: var(--clr-secondary);
    padding: var(--num-m);
    border-radius: var(--num-s);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 5px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5);
  }

  .more {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    inline-size: 100%;
    padding-block: var(--num-l);
    gap: var(--num-m);
  }
</style>
